/**
 * \defgroup control Control
 * \brief Motion planning, hardware interface, and manipulation packages for the OpenArm A1 bimanual arm.
 */

/**
 * \defgroup control_planning Planning & Trajectories
 * \ingroup control
 * \brief Path/motion planning, trajectory shaping, and waypoint generation.
 */

/**
 * \defgroup control_moveit MoveIt Integration
 * \ingroup control
 * \brief MoveIt-based planning interface and the generated MoveIt configuration package.
 */

/**
 * \defgroup control_hw Hardware & Execution
 * \ingroup control
 * \brief ros2_control hardware interface, sequence execution, skills, and gravity compensation.
 */

/**
 * \defgroup communication Communication
 * \brief Message/action/service definitions and device bridges (camera, database, head/arm peripherals).
 */

/**
 * \defgroup utilities Utilities
 * \brief Shared math/computation helpers reused across control and communication packages.
 */

/**
 * \defgroup description Description
 * \brief URDF/Xacro robot description, meshes, and ros2_control configuration.
 */

/**
 * \defgroup builds Builds
 * \brief Top-level demo/test/deployment bring-up packages (openarm_demo, openarm_test, qvic_2026).
 */

